-- ('Most info-web-media-newspaper types have a hard time swallowing the idea that knowledge is reached (mostly) by removing junk from people''s heads.', '大多数信息网络媒体报纸类型的人很难接受这样的观点：知识主要是通过从人们头脑中清除垃圾来获得的。', 31),
-- ('Finer men tolerate others'' small inconsistencies though not the large ones; the weak tolerate others'' large inconsistencies though not small ones.', '优秀的人能容忍他人的小矛盾但不能容忍大矛盾；弱者能容忍他人的大矛盾但不能容忍小矛盾。', 31),
('Randomness is indistinguishable from complicated, undetected, and undetectable order; but order itself is indistinguishable from artful randomness.', '随机性与复杂的、未被发现的、无法检测的秩序无法区分；但秩序本身也与巧妙的随机性无法区分。', 31);